{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46190","headline":"山居诗二十四首 四 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万境忘机是道华，碧芙蓉里日空斜。\n幽深有径通仙窟，寂寞无人落异花。\n掣电浮云真好喻，如龙似凤不须夸。\n君看江上英雄冢，只有松根与柏槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}